OL,3,GNEWSAIsland prepares for bank holiday
OL,4,Agetaway rush
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 18,000 passengers are expected to
OL,7,Fpass through Guernsey's airport and
OL,8,Fharbour over the bank holiday weekend,
OL,9,Fthe island's ports bosses have said.
OL,11,FGuernsey Ports said it was preparing
OL,12,Ffor one of its busiest weekends of the
OL,13,Fyear with 10,000 passengers expected to
OL,14,Fuse the airport between Friday and
OL,15,FMonday and a further 8,000 going
OL,16,Fthrough St Peter Port Harbour.
OL,18,FAirport director Richard Thomasson
OL,19,Fadvised people to plan ahead and ensure
OL,20,Fthey arrived in good time.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
