OL,3,GNEWSAIsland prepares for bank holiday
OL,4,Agetaway rush
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarbour master James Way said the team
OL,7,Fthere would work closely with ferry
OL,8,Foperators to keep passengers moving
OL,9,F"safely and efficiently", adding strong
OL,10,Fwinds forecast for Saturday and Monday
OL,11,Fcould affect some sailings.
